<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Field Studies Fund Application</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-label { width: 200px; }
  .form-input { flex-grow: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 50px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 24pt;">THE ROBERT HOWARD FIELD STUDIES FUND APPLICATION</h1>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Name:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 300px;">Student ID#:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="width: 150px;"><span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Check One:</div>
    <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
      <input type="radio" name="grade" value="graduate"> Graduate
      <input type="radio" name="grade" value="undergraduate"> or undergraduate
      <input type="radio" name="years" value="years_in_program"> Years in program:
      <div class="form-input" style="width: 150px;" data-field="or_undergraduate">{{ or_undergraduate }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Mailing Address:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 2;"><span data-field="mailing_address">{{ mailing_address }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Phone:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="width: 200px;"><span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 300px;">email:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="width: 300px;"><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Field Work Project Description</div>
  <p>Please attach a 250 word document describing the field work project for which these funds will be directed.</p>
  <div class="form-input" style="height: 150px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
    <!-- Placeholder for description -->
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Estimated Expenses</div>
  <p>Estimate the amount of reimbursement you expect and a short list of the expenses you expect:</p>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-label" style="width: 300px;">Expenses (lodging, gas, equipment):</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="expense_list">{{ expense_list }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 300px;">Amount:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="width: 150px;"><span data-field="total_amount">{{ total_amount }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Faculty Attestation</div>
  <p>Please provide the names of at least two faculty that will attest to your academic performance and ability to conduct field research.</p>
  <div class="form-input" style="height: 100px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
    <!-- Placeholder for faculty names -->
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Signed:</div>
      <div class="form-input" style="width: 300px;"><span data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</span></div>
      <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 300px;">Date:</div>
      <div class="form-input" style="width: 150px;"><span data-field="date_signed">{{ date_signed }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">Financial Aid Recipient Information</div>
  <p>If you are a Financial Aid recipient and you would like to know how the scholarship will be coordinated with your financial aid please contact the Financial Aid office (818) 677-4085, office location Bayramian Hall – Student Services Center, first floor East wing or financial.aid@csun.edu</p>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Deadline</div>
  <p>Please turn your application in to <span data-field="submission_email">{{ submission_email }}</span> by the date and time listed on the flyer.</p>

</div>
</body>
</html>